# Atlas Core - Hardened Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Echo Petrov  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D11 11:05  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Design token specification establishing strict color, typography, spacing, and elevation variables for the Atlas Core UI library, aligned with organizational security guidelines extracted from the Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Echo Petrov",
    "securityClassification": "CONFIDENTIAL-INTERNAL",
    "complianceReference": "Business Document: Company Document (evaluated for visual security, contrast compliance, and interface obfuscation requirements)"
  },
  "color": {
    "surface": {
      "primary": { "value": "#0B0F19", "type": "color", "description": "High-contrast primary base to reduce shoulder-surfing visibility" },
      "secondary": { "value": "#1A2234", "type": "color" },
      "critical": { "value": "#D32F2F", "type": "color", "description": "Restricted audit trigger status indicator" }
    },
    "text": {
      "primary": { "value": "#F8FAFC", "type": "color" },
      "masked": { "value": "#64748B", "type": "color", "description": "Applied strictly to redacted data components per Company Document protocols" }
    }
  },
  "spacing": {
    "tight": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" },
    "standard": { "value": "8px", "type": "dimension" },
